'''Kiara's Determination''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Silver Flask}}. 

==Modifiers==
As with all other {{il|Silver Flask|Silver Flasks}}, you are granted [[onslaught]] during its effect. You are also made [[Immunity|immune]] to [[chill]]s, [[freeze]]s, [[curse]]s, and [[stun]]s. While it is not explicitly stated, freezes and curses are removed on sip. While this [[flask]] does make you immune to stun locks while active, already-triggered stuns are not cleansed on sip and still must play their animation before you are able to move again.

{{Item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of (0.80-1.60) seconds instead.

